# AgroBot: Power Architecture & Avionics Signal Distribution

### 1. Primary Electrical Specifications
* **Main Energy Storage:** 24V (8S) 40Ah Lithium Iron Phosphate ($\text{LiFePO}_4$) pack with integrated CAN-bus Battery Management System (BMS).
  * Nominal Voltage: $25.6\text{ V}$
  * Full Charge Voltage: $29.2\text{ V}$
  * Discharge Cutoff Voltage: $20.0\text{ V}$
  * Maximum Continuous Discharge: $60\text{ A}$ ($1.5\text{C}$)
* **Nominal Power Budget:** $24\text{V} \times 3.8\text{A} \approx 91.2\text{ W}$ continuous during autonomous transplanting operation ($>10.2\text{ hours}$ operational field endurance).
* **Peak Transient Draw:** $24\text{V} \times 26.5\text{A} \approx 636\text{ W}$ (simultaneous 4-wheel obstacle climb + dibbler soil impact).

