### 2. Regulated Bus Architecture & Power Rails

```text
  [ 24V 40Ah LiFePO4 Battery ] 
             │
             ├──► [ 60A DC Circuit Breaker / Manual Safety Disconnect ]
             │           │
             │           ├──► 24V Raw Traction Bus (Hub Motors & Stepper Drivers)
             │           │
             │           ├──► [ 24V-to-19V 8A Synchronous Buck ] ──► NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano
             │           │
             │           ├──► [ 24V-to-12V 5A Isolated Buck ] ──► RealSense D435i / Router
             │           │
             │           └──► [ 24V-to-5V 6A Isolated Buck ]
             │                     │
             │                     ├──► STM32 Nucleo-F446RE (Motion MCU)
             │                     ├──► RPLiDAR S2 (2D LiDAR)
             │                     ├──► SparkFun RTK Facet (Dual-band L1/L2 GNSS)
             │                     └──► Low-Noise 5V Analog Rail (HX711 / Load Cell)
